Z||000011||Archie||10-17-2001||12:20 AM||||Well a little more than that.....<P>Look up the LT1 prices on this page <A HREF="http://home.v8archie.com/arch10.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://home.v8archie.com/arch10.htm</A> <P>Chop top Prices <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/choptop.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/choptop.htm</A>  <P>Warber Hood <A HREF="http://home.v8archie.com/warberhood.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://home.v8archie.com/warberhood.htm</A> <P>Add in Wheels & Tires, the IRM integrated rocker panels, Big Brake conversion, Wing stands, A good quality paint job, interior mods & the value of the donor car and you're easily way over $24K. <P>Archie <BR>||||reg||1
